[#- DOCS:

- Output all the sections on the page. 

- I don't use this most of the time. I use
``output_all_sections_except(SECTION_KINDS)`` 
instead. That lets me do things like controlling
how I output the footnotes and references

NOARGS:

-#]

[!- macro output_all_sections_() -!]
[!- for section in sections -!]
[!- include section.template_list -!]
[!- endfor -!]
[!- endmacro -!]

